k \\rightarrow \\inf"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿，系统此时整体的加速比为"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"S = \\frac{1}{1 - \\alpha}","collabId":"13cce01f-f288-4200-b7fa-9d0d56d00260","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a49b70cf-933a-45e2-81c6-396826266113","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设这部分的占比为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"60\\%","collabId":"b4083ff7-503b-40ed-9d6a-965e63c90f27","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"60%"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么系统的加速比为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":" S= 2.5","collabId":"5a38f8df-3882-44fc-8c42-9fb896c6a1f5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":" = 2.5"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿，即使我们对某一点进行了极致的优化，系统整体加速比的提升并没有想象的那么明显，要得到更好的加速比，我们必须优化系统中的大部分组件。"}]}],"tags":["Amdahl 定律"],"createTime":1704901957560,"updateTime":1763390364253,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1763390364253}}